r Early Access and I can confirm that couch coop will be available on Early Access release, including Steam Remote Play!This was not meant to go into the demo build, but grassland levels now have shrubs that have the possibility to create more interesti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T20:12:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682980","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2549980-1845383656383707","game_id":"steam-2549980","kind":"announcement","title":"Gamebreaking doors!","summary":"doors could push you into the wall and make you get stuck forever - this should be fixed!doors open and close faster now - it fits a bit more the speed of the gameinteractables (pickups, ammoboxes, doors) now should work more precise - i.e. they take into account the angle that you are looking at the interactable","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T19:08:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383707","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2549980-1845383656378703","game_id":"steam-2549980","kind":"announcement","title":"Scary explosives, buffed scientists and undroppable fists!","summary":"added new logic for running away of C4/dynamite - this should make friendlies create bigger distance when using explosives. Also they only run away when you TRY to use C4 (close to a wall), not always when you are simply holding itScientist has been buffed with bit more health in the helicopter crash mission. Hopefully it is a little bit easier to survive. Let me know if it's too much!With holding interact button (E) you can drop your current weapon. This is meant for coop games that are on the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T19:00:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378703","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2549980-1844751498229179","game_id":"steam-2549980","kind":"announcement","title":"More keybindings!","summary":"now possible to override keybindings for WASD next/previous weapon is now also exposed as keybindingnow possible to also custom bind keys to scroll wheel up/downThanks for all the reporters in the community!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T13:12:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498229179","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2549980-1844751498227169","game_id":"steam-2549980","kind":"announcement","title":"Adding Korean / gamepad fixes","summary":"Menu bugfixesAdding Korean languages (Thanks Daur Jeon!)Gamepad icons for Xbox/PS should work now","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T12:50:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498227169","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2549980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2549980":"2026-10-26T09:54:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2549980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:19Z"},"4375590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:19Z","last_succes